1. Problem Statement

Students need different technical skills, soft skills, academic performance and practical experience to become employable.

Every student has different levels of programming knowledge, technical skills, communication skills, experience and placement preparation. This project uses the CSE Employability Dataset to study these factors.

In this project, useful features are created from the student data. Feast is used to store and retrieve these features. A machine learning model is also used to predict the employability of a student.

2. Dataset

The dataset contains 100 CSE students and 24 columns.

Number of Skills

There are 15 skill-related columns.

Technical Skills

1. Programming
2. DSA
3. DBMS
4. OS
5. CN
6. Python
7. Java
8. WebDevelopment
9. AI_ML
10. Cloud
11. DevOps
12. CyberSecurity

Soft Skills

